===Etymology===
{{partial calque|fi|gmq-osw|floghdraki||flying snake}}; {{com|fi||alt1=lohi|käärme}}. Originally ''louhikäärme'', the initial component became {{m|fi|lohi||salmon}} by [[folk etymology]].

